WEBVTT

01:40.330 --> 01:43.009
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.090 --> 01:46.050
[Episode 13]

01:47.750 --> 01:50.160
I was afraid of causing the plague to spread,

01:50.160 --> 01:52.789
so I went to live in the cave alone.

01:54.960 --> 01:57.420
There's no concept of time in the mountains.

01:58.140 --> 02:01.470
When the cold weather ends, I don't even know what year it is.

02:01.570 --> 02:02.820
Life is short,

02:05.800 --> 02:07.280
but loneliness is long.

02:08.699 --> 02:10.039
Finally, one day,

02:10.660 --> 02:12.140
I couldn't help it

02:13.270 --> 02:15.270
and went to a town where humans live.

02:17.000 --> 02:18.610
That's where I met Qing Geng.

02:23.220 --> 02:25.990
Qing Geng was the first friend I made.

02:26.579 --> 02:27.790
I was very happy.

02:28.380 --> 02:30.840
Since I went to the town to see Qing Geng a lot,

02:31.180 --> 02:32.960
the plague finally spread.

02:35.190 --> 02:36.579
It was all because of me

02:37.490 --> 02:39.200
that the mortal world I love

02:40.360 --> 02:42.150
turned into a hell.

02:51.570 --> 02:54.570
Since Qing Geng can suppress the source of the plague,

02:55.180 --> 02:57.970
the Baize Goddess could only seal us together.

03:04.320 --> 03:06.520
Am I being too delusional?

03:07.630 --> 03:09.750
I actually want to cure the plague.

03:11.710 --> 03:13.610
Don't be too hard on yourself.

03:14.990 --> 03:16.310
It's all because of you!

03:16.310 --> 03:17.980
I don't want to see you again!

03:22.940 --> 03:24.070
Because of me,

03:25.960 --> 03:27.230
she's trapped

03:27.230 --> 03:30.280
in this dark villa for eternity.

03:29.640 --> 03:32.940
[God Bless Lingxi]

03:33.040 --> 03:34.329
My existence

03:35.410 --> 03:37.470
is Qing Geng's greatest misfortune.

03:42.640 --> 03:43.950
This is my inner core.

03:44.880 --> 03:45.980
Wait.

03:47.280 --> 03:48.750
Could the method

03:50.520 --> 03:52.120
you were talking about be...

04:04.050 --> 04:05.610
As long as I die,

04:07.280 --> 04:09.210
the plague will be gone.

04:18.630 --> 04:19.529
Please.

04:23.110 --> 04:24.610
Don't kill her.

04:26.080 --> 04:27.950
If Qing Geng were gone,

04:29.890 --> 04:31.460
I'd have no friends

04:32.790 --> 04:34.870
in this world anymore.

04:46.370 --> 04:48.520
I'm a beast of calamity.

04:51.100 --> 04:53.500
I don't deserve to live in the mortal world.

04:54.040 --> 04:55.420
But I really

04:56.590 --> 04:59.360
like the bright lights,

05:01.560 --> 05:03.290
the liveliness and happiness,

05:04.940 --> 05:06.480
and the prosperity here.

05:14.050 --> 05:15.900
It's just as a beast of calamity,

05:19.610 --> 05:21.010
I have no choice.

06:22.710 --> 06:23.640
Where is Fei?

06:27.600 --> 06:28.400
He's dead.

06:28.940 --> 06:31.600
He killed himself by destroying his inner core.

06:59.810 --> 07:00.620
Good.

07:02.250 --> 07:04.180
It's actually good that he's dead.

07:05.840 --> 07:07.080
Since he died,

07:10.150 --> 07:11.840
I can be free.

07:17.680 --> 07:18.930
It's not good at all.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.740
Why else would you cry?

07:43.950 --> 07:45.860
Do you know why you cry?

07:48.040 --> 07:50.610
Because Li Lun hid something in you.

08:01.560 --> 08:02.720
I noticed just now that

08:02.720 --> 08:05.250
there's Li Lun's demonic energy in your body.

08:06.750 --> 08:08.510
That's why I asked Mr. Zhuo

08:09.570 --> 08:11.050
to use his blood of Bingyi

08:11.920 --> 08:14.580
to cleanse the evil demonic energy in your body.

08:14.900 --> 08:16.310
Mr. Zhuo

08:16.520 --> 08:18.060
is a man of righteousness.

08:19.050 --> 08:20.170
His blood contains more power

08:20.170 --> 08:22.520
to cleanse the evil energy.

08:54.920 --> 08:56.450
Look at this demonic power.

08:57.620 --> 08:59.110
It's grim and dark.

09:00.940 --> 09:02.210
It's exactly because

09:03.890 --> 09:06.170
it sprouted in your heart

09:07.670 --> 09:08.840
that resentment,

09:08.480 --> 09:11.130
♫A thought in the vicissitudes of time♫

09:09.230 --> 09:10.040
hatred,

09:10.600 --> 09:11.390
and anger

09:11.170 --> 09:15.250
♫Wait until regrets blow all over the desolate world♫

09:12.640 --> 09:15.430
grew into a heavy tree canopy that blocks out all sunshine

09:15.430 --> 09:17.600
♫The inscription is difficult to read♫

09:17.240 --> 09:19.960
and presses you into the shadows of darkness.

09:17.810 --> 09:21.460
♫Time wears away the vows♫

09:21.810 --> 09:24.240
♫Turning the world upside down♫

09:22.680 --> 09:23.880
If Li Lun

09:24.260 --> 09:28.930
♫Can't get the broken yesterday back♫

09:24.840 --> 09:27.100
can possess anyone,

09:27.680 --> 09:29.600
there's no point in sealing him

09:29.340 --> 09:35.010
♫How to turn back time?♫

09:29.600 --> 09:31.060
in the Wilderness at all.

09:31.460 --> 09:33.740
We are dealing with someone

09:34.610 --> 09:36.900
who can never be defeated.

09:35.100 --> 09:37.920
♫I'm willing to break through the cliff♫

09:38.000 --> 09:41.040
♫Turn into a white horse♫

09:38.550 --> 09:40.280
Actually, that's not the case.

09:41.700 --> 09:44.380
♫Crush all the struggles♫

09:44.700 --> 09:48.020
♫Let the suffering bloom♫

09:47.160 --> 09:48.110
Ignite.

09:48.690 --> 09:51.930
♫Write about caring with ruthlessness♫

09:52.040 --> 09:55.130
♫Use a lifetime to remember a moment♫

09:55.290 --> 10:01.470
♫The greatness of vowing to live and die together♫

10:01.550 --> 10:08.490
♫Laugh at the chaotic world's illusion, like flowers in the mirror and moonlight on water♫

10:04.940 --> 10:06.940
Li Lun's enchantment of possession

10:07.600 --> 10:09.010
is extremely self-devouring.

10:08.580 --> 10:14.820
♫Can't let go and turn back, the sea of ​​suffering is endless♫

10:10.340 --> 10:11.810
Every time he uses it,

10:12.530 --> 10:14.120
his lifespan and demonic power

10:14.120 --> 10:15.750
will be greatly depleted.

10:14.940 --> 10:21.640
♫No fear and no worries, there is always a home at the end of the world♫

10:18.250 --> 10:21.310
So every time we destroy the demoniac Li Lun possesses,

10:21.700 --> 10:23.560
it'll be a heavy blow to him.

10:21.840 --> 10:28.210
♫Warm the scars along the way with the sunset♫

10:24.840 --> 10:27.310
He destroyed my demoniac again.

10:29.640 --> 10:31.200
Zhao Yuanzhou.

10:34.130 --> 10:36.050
Well played.

10:41.080 --> 10:42.280
Burning rhino horns

10:42.280 --> 10:43.680
can connect Yin and Yang,

10:44.290 --> 10:48.220
and help me attract the malicious energy inside and outside the villa.

10:49.730 --> 10:51.060
The rhino horn incense.

10:53.440 --> 10:55.700
This incense must have been lit by Li Lun.

10:57.110 --> 10:58.770
It's been affecting your mind

10:58.800 --> 11:00.400
day by day.

11:01.690 --> 11:02.800
Now,

11:03.480 --> 11:05.240
you can listen to your heart.

11:08.460 --> 11:10.050
Do you really hate Fei?

11:21.790 --> 11:23.430
♫A light flickers♫

11:23.490 --> 11:26.270
♫Far in the distance♫

11:26.370 --> 11:27.570
♫Scars♫

11:28.070 --> 11:30.750
♫Nourished gently by rain♫

11:30.910 --> 11:32.420
♫The window opened by the wind♫

11:32.510 --> 11:33.760
♫Softly sways♫

11:33.840 --> 11:37.130
♫But time slips away♫

11:35.840 --> 11:37.480
Bravo!

11:37.540 --> 11:40.060
♫Hastily♫

11:40.120 --> 11:44.410
♫You wear candlelight like a robe, awaiting dawn♫

11:44.080 --> 11:46.650
This is the annual Prayer Ceremony of Sinan Water Town.

11:44.700 --> 11:48.980
♫While I cradle heartache, year after year, on and on♫

11:46.840 --> 11:49.400
It's said that those who hang their tokens high

11:49.250 --> 11:50.960
♫In dreams, my hometown♫

11:49.520 --> 11:51.240
will be safe and healthy next year,

11:51.020 --> 11:51.950
♫Lies under frost♫

11:51.320 --> 11:52.490
and all their wishes will come true.

11:52.010 --> 11:55.490
♫All sounds♫

11:53.570 --> 11:55.370
Then I'll hang mine the highest.

11:55.790 --> 11:58.090
♫Are lost♫

11:58.280 --> 12:03.120
♫The wind brushes against rivers and hills♫

12:03.160 --> 12:07.070
♫Wild blooms refuse to fall♫

12:07.120 --> 12:12.270
♫They've seen every hue the world has borne♫

12:12.330 --> 12:16.240
♫Which blossom is meant for me?♫

12:16.690 --> 12:21.280
♫As songs are sung, how many truly understand?♫

12:21.430 --> 12:25.100
♫The varied regrets we sing repeatedly♫

12:25.400 --> 12:28.340
♫Have echoed for years♫

12:28.570 --> 12:33.270
♫Hoping fate will amend♫

12:33.700 --> 12:37.400
♫Remember me, a humble♫

12:38.550 --> 12:39.880
♫Blossom♫

12:40.320 --> 12:40.960
Wait.

12:43.450 --> 12:46.850
You made me drop my token, and you want to leave just like that?

12:49.470 --> 12:51.920
My wind chimes.

12:53.530 --> 12:54.370
So...

12:54.640 --> 12:55.970
What do you want me to do?

12:59.120 --> 13:00.050
Hang it up for me.

13:15.910 --> 13:20.750
♫The wind brushes against rivers and hills♫

13:20.790 --> 13:24.620
♫Wild blooms refuse to fall♫

13:21.160 --> 13:22.270
It's raining.

13:22.350 --> 13:23.190
It's okay.

13:23.470 --> 13:24.930
I'm not afraid of the rain.

13:25.080 --> 13:29.790
♫They've seen every hue the world has borne♫

13:25.600 --> 13:27.130
Where do you want to hang it?

13:29.900 --> 13:34.180
♫Which blossom is meant for me?♫

13:34.290 --> 13:38.940
♫Those who understand the song will be moved to tears♫

13:39.150 --> 13:42.760
♫Hold our hands tightly but don't say anything♫

13:43.040 --> 13:45.770
♫Watch the fate of the world♫

13:46.080 --> 13:51.080
♫The candle in the wind♫

13:51.340 --> 13:54.870
♫It remembers the past♫

13:55.940 --> 13:58.170
♫We shared♫

14:01.350 --> 14:02.750
You want us to be friends?

14:02.920 --> 14:03.360
Yes.

14:03.560 --> 14:04.200
Friends.

14:05.000 --> 14:05.800
What's wrong?

14:05.840 --> 14:06.700
Is it a bad idea?

14:06.910 --> 14:07.730
No.

14:08.270 --> 14:09.330
Of course it's not.

14:09.550 --> 14:10.790
It's just

14:11.290 --> 14:13.170
I've never had a friend before.

14:16.520 --> 14:18.060
I'm a beast of calamity.

14:18.620 --> 14:21.020
I don't deserve to live in the mortal world.

14:22.050 --> 14:23.660
But I love this mortal world.

14:24.760 --> 14:26.260
It's lively

14:26.840 --> 14:27.920
and prosperous.

14:29.280 --> 14:31.010
But as a beast of calamity,

14:33.170 --> 14:34.330
I have no choice.

14:38.770 --> 14:41.030
That's why I didn't dare to approach you.

14:50.780 --> 14:51.910
But I dare to choose.

14:59.800 --> 15:01.480
Why do you like everything?

15:01.740 --> 15:02.410
Yes.

15:02.490 --> 15:05.670
[Together]

15:02.870 --> 15:03.730
I like them all.

15:04.400 --> 15:06.040
I like everything

15:06.400 --> 15:07.680
in the mortal world.

15:10.030 --> 15:11.760
You don't like the Wilderness?

15:15.860 --> 15:16.870
The Wilderness

15:17.450 --> 15:18.740
is too desolate

15:18.770 --> 15:20.030
and too lonely.

15:20.400 --> 15:21.370
I don't like it.

15:50.090 --> 15:50.790
Look.

15:50.790 --> 15:51.630
I'm climbing up.

15:51.630 --> 15:52.320
Be careful.

15:52.320 --> 15:53.240
It's slippery since it's raining.

15:53.240 --> 15:53.800
Okay.

16:00.960 --> 16:03.020
Fei fled to the mortal world secretly

16:03.030 --> 16:05.230
and caused one disaster after another.

16:05.410 --> 16:07.470
I must take him back to the Wilderness

16:08.140 --> 16:09.600
and seal him for eternity.

16:14.090 --> 16:15.750
I was born to avoid the plague,

16:15.780 --> 16:17.440
so I'm incompatible with Fei.

16:18.250 --> 16:19.580
I'm willing to

16:20.030 --> 16:22.360
be sealed together with Fei for eternity.

16:22.360 --> 16:24.310
Your true form is a blue bird.

16:25.800 --> 16:29.060
You're supposed to pursue the freedom of flying in the sky.

16:29.080 --> 16:31.080
Are you sure you want to choose this?

16:31.760 --> 16:33.780
At least I still have a choice.

16:35.860 --> 16:37.250
But what about Fei?

16:38.980 --> 16:41.230
He was born as a beast of calamity.

16:44.550 --> 16:46.100
Does he have a choice?

16:47.280 --> 16:48.910
This is my choice.

16:49.350 --> 16:51.360
Please grant my wish, Goddess.

17:18.810 --> 17:22.790
[Lingxi Villa]

17:32.180 --> 17:35.390
[Lingxi Villa]

17:35.440 --> 17:36.600
[God Bless Lingxi]

17:50.500 --> 17:51.590
It's all my fault.

17:52.930 --> 17:54.460
I dragged you into this.

18:01.400 --> 18:03.240
I can be with you forever.

18:07.130 --> 18:08.600
You'll regret it.

18:09.950 --> 18:10.960
I won't.

18:18.500 --> 18:20.360
Fei never knew

18:18.630 --> 18:24.970
[God Bless Lingxi]

18:21.240 --> 18:23.440
I volunteered to

18:24.320 --> 18:26.050
be sealed in the villa with him.

18:31.560 --> 18:34.110
♫The hazy dusk approaches♫

18:35.060 --> 18:37.800
♫The old days are sinking and weighing heavy on my heart♫

18:38.380 --> 18:41.850
♫A great dream covers new clothes♫

18:41.910 --> 18:44.500
♫Sleeping without waking♫

18:43.440 --> 18:44.960
I won't be able to finish sweeping if you keep doing this.

18:44.820 --> 18:48.220
♫Let the spring light hear♫

18:48.600 --> 18:51.550
♫The autumn moon also hears♫

18:51.610 --> 18:54.560
♫Every rainfall♫

18:54.620 --> 18:58.000
♫Is my secret♫

18:58.100 --> 19:01.780
♫Searching memories endlessly♫

19:01.860 --> 19:04.770
♫The drenched past♫

19:04.940 --> 19:07.760
♫Reflects you♫

19:08.440 --> 19:10.180
As time goes by,

19:08.440 --> 19:11.230
♫Find you♫

19:10.680 --> 19:12.510
only those mountains we can see from the villa

19:11.690 --> 19:14.480
♫Find you♫

19:12.510 --> 19:14.210
never get old.

19:15.160 --> 19:16.960
Time passes so slowly.

19:18.350 --> 19:20.010
During that time,

19:20.200 --> 19:22.360
I did feel lonely and bored from time to time.

19:22.360 --> 19:25.690
I'd want to go out and see the prosperous mortal world again.

19:26.960 --> 19:28.860
But whenever I saw

19:29.280 --> 19:30.520
Fei be happy

19:30.540 --> 19:32.190
because of my company,

19:32.270 --> 19:33.680
I'd feel that

19:34.470 --> 19:36.310
even if I had to be here forever,

19:36.330 --> 19:37.910
it'd be worth it.

19:40.220 --> 19:41.400
Amazing.

19:42.820 --> 19:44.480
It's better-looking than me.

19:48.160 --> 19:50.090
You look as good as in the portrait.

19:54.360 --> 19:55.410
Until

19:56.000 --> 19:57.820
Li Lun found me.

20:36.010 --> 20:38.330
Let me lend you the Truth Eye.

20:39.400 --> 20:41.260
Turn around and take a look at him.

20:42.850 --> 20:45.100
See him in his true colors.

21:07.440 --> 21:09.920
People used to worship you as God.

21:10.640 --> 21:14.140
Now look at this shabby place.

21:15.820 --> 21:18.280
These dusty sitting statues.

21:18.880 --> 21:20.580
Why do you have to

21:20.630 --> 21:22.960
be the one to make up for the tragedy

21:23.920 --> 21:25.950
caused by Fei?

21:42.380 --> 21:43.980
The Baize Goddess

21:44.000 --> 21:46.800
presented a false picture of peace and prosperity

21:46.820 --> 21:48.730
and claimed to be fair.

21:49.600 --> 21:51.350
But she is a human herself,

21:52.330 --> 21:53.810
not a demon.

21:54.830 --> 21:58.180
She couldn't understand the pain and struggle of the demon.

21:59.710 --> 22:01.830
Every choice she made

22:02.760 --> 22:04.660
was to sacrifice demons' lives

22:04.840 --> 22:06.660
to protect humans.

22:07.870 --> 22:09.630
Is that fair?

22:09.830 --> 22:11.280
Your sacrifice

22:11.920 --> 22:14.030
is completely meaningless.

22:15.990 --> 22:18.160
Do you want to save Fei?

22:36.810 --> 22:39.200
All the harsh words I said to him...

22:40.050 --> 22:41.380
It's all because of you!

22:41.400 --> 22:43.000
I don't want to see you again!

22:44.550 --> 22:46.340
I didn't mean them at all.

22:51.850 --> 22:54.640
But I never regretted

22:56.650 --> 22:58.590
the days I spent with him.

23:02.960 --> 23:05.020
It's just that I hadn't had the chance

23:05.590 --> 23:07.640
to tell him this.

23:10.070 --> 23:12.280
He could never hear it.

23:15.160 --> 23:16.620
Don't blame yourself.

23:17.880 --> 23:20.160
The real culprit is not you.

23:23.520 --> 23:24.720
It's Li Lun.

23:31.400 --> 23:32.440
Zhuo!

23:32.730 --> 23:33.470
Brother Zhuo.

23:33.470 --> 23:34.360
The plague is not gone.

23:34.360 --> 23:35.040
Wen Xiao.

23:36.120 --> 23:37.240
Wen Xiao.

23:38.160 --> 23:40.240
But the plague was caused by Fei.

23:40.260 --> 23:42.040
Isn't he already dead?

23:43.890 --> 23:44.530
Mr. Zhuo!

23:44.650 --> 23:45.380
Jiu!

23:45.600 --> 23:46.200
Bad news!

23:46.500 --> 23:47.090
Ms. Pei!

23:47.190 --> 23:47.670
Ms. Pei!

23:47.820 --> 23:49.080
-Sister Pei.
-Ms. Pei.

23:50.600 --> 23:51.610
Sister Pei.

24:03.260 --> 24:04.620
The plague caused by Fei

24:04.640 --> 24:05.950
can't be cured.

24:08.010 --> 24:08.920
I'm sorry.

24:08.950 --> 24:10.430
It's my fault.

24:12.800 --> 24:13.990
I didn't expect

24:14.320 --> 24:16.200
our final ending

24:17.210 --> 24:18.980
would be to die of illness.

24:20.460 --> 24:22.470
But at least we will die together.

24:22.550 --> 24:24.150
It still counts as a happy ending.

24:24.150 --> 24:25.260
Happy ending?

24:26.690 --> 24:28.400
I'm so unlucky

24:29.440 --> 24:31.970
to have to die with you.

24:35.550 --> 24:37.230
Aren't you a great demon?

24:38.160 --> 24:40.620
If you were also to be defeated by the plague,

24:41.080 --> 24:43.180
wouldn't it be too pathetic?

24:44.430 --> 24:46.270
Do something.

24:47.830 --> 24:49.540
I may not die.

24:50.270 --> 24:51.680
But I'll be ill and

24:51.920 --> 24:53.580
half-dead like this forever.

24:53.580 --> 24:55.120
Isn't that even more miserable?

24:55.120 --> 24:56.890
I'll have to take care of your funeral affairs

24:56.890 --> 24:58.420
with this sick body.

24:58.440 --> 24:59.550
God forbid!

24:59.580 --> 25:01.250
I won't accept that we'll just all die together.

25:01.250 --> 25:02.660
I'll go work on the antidote.

25:02.660 --> 25:03.940
There must be a way.

25:04.990 --> 25:05.800
Jiu!

25:35.170 --> 25:36.680
If you feel sick,

25:37.000 --> 25:38.650
you can lean on my shoulder.

25:40.990 --> 25:42.250
Are you that reliable?

25:51.590 --> 25:53.910
You're indeed more reliable, Mr. Zhuo.

25:54.520 --> 25:55.240
Your shoulders

25:55.240 --> 25:56.280
carry it all.

25:56.900 --> 25:57.950
Thank you.

25:58.370 --> 25:59.880
Are you praising me?

26:03.080 --> 26:04.930
I'm just telling the truth.

26:05.170 --> 26:07.170
If you hadn't been so smart,

26:08.020 --> 26:09.000
pretended to faint,

26:09.000 --> 26:10.600
and gone deep into the tiger's den, Mr. Zhuo,

26:10.600 --> 26:11.440
we couldn't have

26:11.440 --> 26:13.370
found the real culprit so quickly.

26:15.860 --> 26:17.570
The real culprit

26:18.930 --> 26:20.420
is Li Lun.

26:22.280 --> 26:23.990
To be precise, it's Li Lun

26:24.310 --> 26:25.710
and Chongwu Camp.

26:27.150 --> 26:29.150
I didn't expect them to join forces.

26:32.360 --> 26:34.000
Li Lun planted

26:34.070 --> 26:35.840
the dark evil aura in Qing Geng

26:36.170 --> 26:37.980
to make her angry

26:38.120 --> 26:39.620
and spread the plague.

26:40.320 --> 26:42.010
And then, he kidnapped Jiu

26:42.780 --> 26:44.770
to lure Mr. Zhuo away.

26:46.320 --> 26:47.580
So that mysterious man

26:47.760 --> 26:49.230
kidnapped me here

26:50.090 --> 26:52.240
to use my Cloud Light Sword to kill you

26:52.520 --> 26:53.920
and take your inner core.

26:54.640 --> 26:56.120
Li Lun is a demon himself.

26:57.280 --> 26:59.130
Why does he want your inner core?

27:04.250 --> 27:06.460
When Qing Geng imprisoned me,

27:07.400 --> 27:09.330
she used Qin Yuan's poison needle.

27:10.490 --> 27:12.100
Qin Yuan's poison needle?

27:13.720 --> 27:14.940
Qin Yuan

27:16.260 --> 27:17.860
is shaped like a bee.

27:17.950 --> 27:19.270
It's as big as a mandarin duck.

27:19.270 --> 27:22.070
When birds and beasts are stung by it, they'll die.

27:22.120 --> 27:24.580
When plants are stung by it, they'll wither.

27:25.200 --> 27:27.240
Chongwu Camp figured out

27:27.740 --> 27:29.920
how to make Qin Yuan's poison needle years ago.

27:29.920 --> 27:31.180
The medicine is ready.

27:33.790 --> 27:35.020
But it's very potent.

27:35.050 --> 27:36.270
I'm not sure.

27:36.830 --> 27:39.360
What if it makes your condition even worse...

27:48.170 --> 27:49.370
Mr. Zhuo.

27:49.520 --> 27:50.710
Let me try it.

27:51.240 --> 27:52.720
I won't die anyway.

27:53.210 --> 27:55.610
There's no room for my condition to worsen.

28:05.600 --> 28:06.560
How does it feel?

28:08.400 --> 28:09.200
Bitter.

28:12.560 --> 28:13.440
I'm asking how you feel,

28:13.440 --> 28:14.520
not how it tastes.

28:17.550 --> 28:19.240
I feel bad.

28:19.700 --> 28:20.570
But I checked

28:20.600 --> 28:22.960
the prescription left on Qing Geng's table.

28:22.960 --> 28:25.400
This is indeed a prescription to cure the plague.

28:25.400 --> 28:27.000
But why doesn't it work?

28:27.850 --> 28:28.950
Qing Geng

28:28.950 --> 28:30.240
once told me

28:31.240 --> 28:33.100
she had studied it for many years,

28:34.180 --> 28:35.550
but it seems

28:35.830 --> 28:37.310
there's still one enhancing ingredient missing

28:37.310 --> 28:40.370
which could combine the power of all herbs.

28:40.640 --> 28:41.970
Enhancing ingredient?

28:44.030 --> 28:46.060
Qing Geng lives on a cypress tree

28:46.490 --> 28:48.490
and feeds on its flowers and fruits.

28:49.470 --> 28:50.400
Avoid plague...

28:51.910 --> 28:53.350
Cypress tree...

28:54.800 --> 28:57.060
I know what the enhancing ingredient is!

29:03.120 --> 29:06.530
It's said that when trees grow over 100 years, it will cultivate spiritual energy.

29:06.530 --> 29:08.040
Qing Geng likes living here,

29:08.040 --> 29:09.840
and she feeds on the flowers and fruits on the tree.

29:09.840 --> 29:12.240
That's why she managed to avoid the plague.

29:13.030 --> 29:14.950
But this tree has withered.

29:15.040 --> 29:16.200
There're no flowers or fruits,

29:16.200 --> 29:17.610
not even laves.

29:17.760 --> 29:18.760
What should we do?

29:20.760 --> 29:22.160
How about using the bark?

29:25.600 --> 29:26.570
Let's peel it.

29:29.880 --> 29:30.860
My heart aches.

29:32.070 --> 29:33.200
My hand hurts, okay?

29:33.640 --> 29:34.380
Alright, your palm hurts.

29:34.380 --> 29:35.340
Here.

29:39.400 --> 29:40.200
This won't do.

29:40.360 --> 29:41.760
The bark is too hard.

29:41.790 --> 29:43.070
I have to borrow

29:43.070 --> 29:45.570
the Cloud Light Sword from Mr. Zhuo and try again.

29:45.570 --> 29:46.760
Don't bother.

29:47.480 --> 29:48.160
Check out

29:48.180 --> 29:49.100
the awesome swordsmanship

29:49.100 --> 29:50.300
of me, a Mountain God.

29:58.190 --> 29:59.310
Oh my god.

29:59.710 --> 30:01.260
This is too weird.

30:11.590 --> 30:12.760
I did it, right?

30:13.790 --> 30:14.380
Yes.

30:14.840 --> 30:15.430
Jiu.

30:15.560 --> 30:16.560
Thank you.

30:17.580 --> 30:18.450
It's nothing.

30:19.050 --> 30:20.780
Don't worry about it, Mr. Zhuo.

30:46.000 --> 30:46.660
Sister Pei.

30:47.060 --> 30:47.770
Be careful.

30:58.750 --> 30:59.710
It's hot.

31:07.610 --> 31:08.810
Little Mountain God.

31:08.950 --> 31:10.080
Thank you.

31:11.170 --> 31:12.100
You're welcome.

31:12.110 --> 31:13.680
This is all thanks to Bai Jiu.

31:13.680 --> 31:14.420
I

31:14.450 --> 31:15.040
just

31:15.040 --> 31:16.170
worked in collusion

31:16.400 --> 31:17.360
with him.

31:20.280 --> 31:21.240
This is not

31:22.150 --> 31:23.750
how this word should be used.

31:24.760 --> 31:26.200
Really?

31:26.560 --> 31:27.840
Let me put it another way.

31:27.840 --> 31:29.080
Jiu and I

31:29.080 --> 31:29.960
are

31:30.120 --> 31:31.390
birds of a feather.

31:35.740 --> 31:36.660
I'm so tired.

31:38.300 --> 31:39.830
Take a rest if you're tired.

31:42.930 --> 31:45.430
[Lingxi Villa]

31:48.150 --> 31:49.120
Qing Geng.

31:49.830 --> 31:51.230
You spread the plague.

31:51.600 --> 31:54.030
You should be punished for the crime you committed.

31:54.030 --> 31:57.230
But considering the fact that you were deceived by Li Lun,

31:57.250 --> 31:59.000
and you volunteered to

31:59.570 --> 32:01.960
be imprisoned for 100 years for the people

32:01.990 --> 32:03.800
back then even though you were innocent,

32:03.800 --> 32:05.730
that should count as an atonement.

32:07.240 --> 32:08.650
I promised Fei

32:08.670 --> 32:10.060
I wouldn't punish you.

32:12.750 --> 32:13.750
Now,

32:13.930 --> 32:15.750
I'll remove the seal for you.

32:16.510 --> 32:20.230
[Lingxi Villa]

32:26.480 --> 32:27.940
I was born to avoid the plague,

32:27.940 --> 32:29.470
so I'm incompatible with Fei.

32:29.470 --> 32:30.840
I'm willing to

32:31.080 --> 32:33.410
be sealed together with Fei for eternity.

32:33.990 --> 32:36.840
You're supposed to pursue the freedom of flying in the sky.

32:36.840 --> 32:38.840
Are you sure you want to choose this?

32:39.180 --> 32:41.340
At least I still have a choice.

32:42.060 --> 32:43.330
But what about Fei?

32:44.820 --> 32:47.940
Birds are supposed to fly among the mountains.

32:49.670 --> 32:50.910
You shouldn't be trapped

32:50.910 --> 32:52.130
under this low roof.

33:03.150 --> 33:05.050
I started the plague.

33:07.150 --> 33:08.230
The Baize Goddess

33:08.920 --> 33:10.380
did make a mistake.

33:12.230 --> 33:13.560
It's hard to justify it.

33:19.560 --> 33:21.040
If there's an afterlife,

33:23.330 --> 33:24.220
Qing Geng,

33:26.050 --> 33:28.360
I hope you can be an ordinary bird

33:29.200 --> 33:31.990
and meet some new bird friends.

33:35.620 --> 33:37.960
Don't meet a demon like me again.

34:19.719 --> 34:25.760
♫Someday I'll return to my old hometown♫

34:26.580 --> 34:33.300
♫Wearing old clothes but with eyes shining bright♫

34:33.350 --> 34:35.360
♫Holding brilliance in the right hand♫

34:35.440 --> 34:37.230
♫Biting down on all panic♫

34:37.270 --> 34:39.040
♫Wiping away frost with the left hand♫

34:39.080 --> 34:40.730
♫I finally look up♫

34:40.790 --> 34:43.690
♫You're in front of me♫

34:44.560 --> 34:47.810
♫Blocking the pain♫

35:03.100 --> 35:04.050
What is this?

35:05.060 --> 35:06.720
This is one of Ran Yi's scales.

35:07.310 --> 35:08.610
It can help people

35:08.950 --> 35:10.340
hide in their dreams.

35:11.630 --> 35:14.300
Most of those who choose to indulge in their dreams

35:14.300 --> 35:16.200
want to escape.

35:19.740 --> 35:20.780
Perhaps

35:20.830 --> 35:22.850
it's not necessarily escaping,

35:23.980 --> 35:25.480
but choosing.

35:27.600 --> 35:30.000
There are thousands of laws in the world...

35:30.640 --> 35:33.770
But none of them can defeat a single word of willingness.

35:37.490 --> 35:39.130
You saw what I wrote?

35:43.320 --> 35:45.070
Mr. Zhuo saw it.

35:48.510 --> 35:49.450
There are

35:49.490 --> 35:51.220
thousands of laws in the world,

35:52.180 --> 35:53.640
but none of them can defeat

35:53.890 --> 35:55.550
a single word of willingness.

35:56.740 --> 35:58.390
The plague is gone.

35:58.680 --> 35:59.590
Now, Qing Geng

35:59.100 --> 36:01.470
[God Bless Lingxi]

35:59.630 --> 36:01.550
can finally leave this place.

36:01.760 --> 36:03.080
She's been trapped here for over 100 years.

36:03.080 --> 36:03.790
If I were her,

36:03.790 --> 36:05.120
I would have gone crazy.

36:05.800 --> 36:07.520
I don't think she'll leave.

36:07.630 --> 36:08.790
I agree.

36:14.600 --> 36:15.320
Mr. Zhuo

36:15.370 --> 36:16.810
and Ms. Pei.

36:16.840 --> 36:18.070
You used to hate demons the most,

36:18.070 --> 36:20.490
but now you've empathized with demons?

36:23.880 --> 36:25.360
Is he always like this?

36:26.660 --> 36:27.420
Yes.

36:28.360 --> 36:29.280
What?

36:32.730 --> 36:33.660
Where's Jiu?

37:07.840 --> 37:09.080
Mother!

37:09.820 --> 37:10.560
Jiu.

37:10.580 --> 37:11.870
-Come here!
-I want to see my mother!

37:11.870 --> 37:12.560
It's okay.

37:12.560 --> 37:13.690
Your mother is okay.

37:14.330 --> 37:15.130
Jiu!

37:15.200 --> 37:16.000
Jiu!

37:30.120 --> 37:30.920
Jiu.

37:33.330 --> 37:34.060
Jiu.

37:41.290 --> 37:41.970
Jiu.

37:45.560 --> 37:46.690
Brother Zhuo.

37:48.070 --> 37:51.270
I called your name several times, but you didn't respond.

37:51.720 --> 37:52.650
What's wrong?

37:54.230 --> 37:55.550
I thought of my mother.

37:59.980 --> 38:02.140
The demon that killed my mother

38:03.720 --> 38:04.990
was also a tree.

38:20.000 --> 38:20.960
So

38:22.020 --> 38:23.620
you're very scared of trees?

38:27.480 --> 38:29.010
Although trees are silent,

38:30.020 --> 38:31.390
they're calm

38:32.000 --> 38:32.800
and tolerant.

38:33.070 --> 38:35.400
They can always absorb your bad emotions.

38:35.770 --> 38:37.020
When I was a kid,

38:37.270 --> 38:40.600
my father and older brother used to go hunt demons together.

38:40.890 --> 38:42.550
They'd leave me alone at home.

38:45.850 --> 38:47.320
I'd talk to that big tree

38:47.320 --> 38:48.710
in the yard.

38:47.470 --> 38:52.750
♫There're no worries in its eyes♫

38:50.680 --> 38:51.790
Sometimes,

38:52.070 --> 38:54.040
I'd think of it as my older brother,

38:52.800 --> 38:58.050
♫It just wants to sleep on a roof♫

38:54.450 --> 38:55.370
and I'd cry to

38:55.590 --> 38:56.590
and smile at it.

38:58.840 --> 38:59.560
In the end,

38:59.020 --> 39:01.880
♫The river flows east and west♫

39:00.670 --> 39:02.390
I'd fall asleep under the tree.

39:02.110 --> 39:04.980
♫The moonlight shines north and south♫

39:05.050 --> 39:06.010
Yichen.

39:05.500 --> 39:10.760
♫Lonely eyes can't make it through the dawn♫

39:06.040 --> 39:07.390
What are you doing?

39:09.320 --> 39:11.360
I saw you look good wearing a headband,

39:11.360 --> 39:14.420
♫Time is quiet♫

39:11.680 --> 39:13.080
so I wanted to wear it too.

39:13.530 --> 39:14.630
Wearing headbands

39:14.950 --> 39:17.900
♫And noisy at the same time♫

39:15.620 --> 39:17.070
is not for good looks.

39:17.100 --> 39:18.300
Then what is it for?

39:18.320 --> 39:22.700
♫How many are the fallen flowers♫

39:19.700 --> 39:21.960
It's for self-restraint and self-love.

39:22.810 --> 39:24.290
It's to remind you to behave yourself.

39:23.520 --> 39:26.470
♫My heart is burning♫

39:26.710 --> 39:29.740
♫The snowflakes are falling♫

39:30.190 --> 39:35.110
♫A heartbeat of cold and heat♫

39:35.950 --> 39:39.000
♫The world is beautiful♫

39:39.500 --> 39:42.020
♫But troubled♫

39:42.820 --> 39:47.370
♫It's going home♫

39:45.730 --> 39:47.860
After hearing what you said, Mr. Zhuo,

39:48.920 --> 39:50.800
I'm not that scared anymore.

39:49.150 --> 39:53.550
♫I'm going home♫

39:53.900 --> 39:55.830
But you're still scared of demons,

39:55.840 --> 39:56.580
right?

39:57.550 --> 40:03.280
♫Has anyone seen a bird with a broken tail?♫

40:00.470 --> 40:02.820
There are so many demons in the Wilderness.

40:02.820 --> 40:04.270
Are you scared?

40:03.600 --> 40:09.440
♫The rain wet its feathers♫

40:05.500 --> 40:07.300
There are demons all over there.

40:09.560 --> 40:11.140
Of course I'm still scared.

40:11.440 --> 40:17.320
♫Its cry has never been heard♫

40:12.200 --> 40:13.240
But

40:13.260 --> 40:14.700
with you

40:15.020 --> 40:17.600
and your powerful Cloud Light Sword here, Mr. Zhuo,

40:17.600 --> 40:23.880
♫Only I know its story♫

40:17.730 --> 40:19.570
I'm not that scared.

40:21.730 --> 40:22.190
Good.

40:22.880 --> 40:24.010
You'll be all right.

40:53.820 --> 40:55.840
Zhao Yuanzhou.

40:55.900 --> 40:58.580
Baize Goddess.

40:58.960 --> 41:03.190
Now that you can freely seal and break the seal,

41:04.800 --> 41:07.710
it seems that you've had a mutual understanding,

41:08.700 --> 41:11.100
and your minds are in sync.

41:15.840 --> 41:16.960
How nice.

41:21.520 --> 41:23.430
How nice.

41:31.640 --> 41:33.280
How nice.
